# Changes to CI, the scripts it runs and the security policy need the
# repository owner's review. Pull requests are opened by an automation
# identity, so this review is a second pair of eyes, not a self-approval.
/.github/   @jpfigueredo
/scripts/   @jpfigueredo
/security/  @jpfigueredo
# The Node version CI runs every step with, the dependency gates included.
/.nvmrc     @jpfigueredo
# What decides which Swagger UI the rust-api build embeds and whether that
# build may download it: the pinned hash, the fail-closed cargo default and
# the Dockerfile that runs both.
/services/rust-api/scripts/     @jpfigueredo
/services/rust-api/.cargo/      @jpfigueredo
/services/rust-api/Dockerfile   @jpfigueredo
